  end
  subgraph Providers["Calendar providers"]
    GG[Google Calendar API - OAuth 2.0 + PKCE, mocked-tested only]
    MS[Microsoft Graph - not implemented]
  end
  UI -->|HTTPS, no key| PX
  PX -->|HTTPS + X-API-Key| FU --> API
  API --> DB
  API -->|bearer token, only after explicit confirmation| GG
  API -.->|planned| MS
